  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_analysis": [
    "ZKUtil.getData catches injected NoNodeException and returns null.",
    "MasterAddressTracker.getMasterInfoPort(ZKWatcher) explicitly throws IOException on null.",
    "ActiveMasterManager.getActiveMasterInfoPort catches that IOException and returns sentinel 0.",
    "TestRSStatusPage captures this earlier 0, then asserts that a later RegionServer page link equals host:0. The page uses a separate cached MasterAddressTracker read; no fetched HTML was retained, so actual link value is unknown.",
    "The selected exception and JUnit mismatch do not prove a wrong later page, persistent znode absence, or a new product bug."
  ],
